-- CONTRACT --------------- errors/pure_violation_4.march

`mod Pure` (declared `cap pure`) declares `needs IO.FileRead`, but a pure module cannot hold a capability: `needs` exists only to admit side effects, directly or through a stdlib wrapper such as `File.read` or `DateTime.now`. [pure_violation]

Remove the `needs` line, and move the code that needs it to a module without `cap pure`.

11 |     needs IO.FileRead
